                            <comment id="14394049" author="rdblue" created="Fri, 3 Apr 2015 04:40:30 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I&apos;m attaching the wrapper script for semver I used to show all the changes.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14394061" author="rdblue" created="Fri, 3 Apr 2015 04:55:15 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I opened issues for the incompatibilities above and marked them as blockers.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;I&apos;ll fix &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PARQUET-234&quot; title=&quot;Restore ParquetInputSplit methods from 1.5.0&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;PARQUET-234&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;PARQUET-234&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PARQUET-237&quot; title=&quot;Check ParquetWriter constructor compatibility with 1.5.0&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;PARQUET-237&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;PARQUET-237&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PARQUET-220&quot; title=&quot;Unnecessary warning in ParquetRecordReader.initialize&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;PARQUET-220&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;PARQUET-220&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PARQUET-230&quot; title=&quot;Add build instructions to the README&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;PARQUET-230&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;PARQUET-230&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; need reviews&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PARQUET-235&quot; title=&quot;Fix compatibility of parquet.metadata with 1.5.0&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;PARQUET-235&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;PARQUET-235&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; needs to be discussed (part of the API?)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Someone needs to claim &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PARQUET-236&quot; title=&quot;Check parquet-scrooge compatibility&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;PARQUET-236&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;PARQUET-236&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</comment>
                            <comment id="14497318" author="rdblue" created="Wed, 15 Apr 2015 23:41:53 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;The IPMC release vote just passed, so 1.6.0 is officially released. I&apos;ve updated the release SVN and it should propagate to mirrors in the next day or so.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17857174" author="rok" created="Sun, 23 Jun 2024 03:27:15 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;This issue has been migrated to &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/parquet-java/issues/1426&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;issue #1426&lt;/a&gt; on GitHub. Please see the &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PARQUET-2502&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;migration documentation&lt;/a&gt; for further details.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
